			"Message": "style(Rest): Remove inter-statement whitespace from unit tests\n\nRevert the blank lines added between logical sections in test functions (setup, config construction, assertions) in tests/unit/oxc_compiler.rs. The previous spacing introduced in recent style commits reduced vertical density without improving clarity for this test suite.\n\nEach test function — test_parser_basic, test_transformer_basic, test_codegen_basic, test_decorator_metadata, test_use_define_for_class_fields, test_sequential_compilation_no_segfault, test_transformer_config_derivation, test_parser_config_derivation, and test_compile_performance — now reads as a compact block. Assertion messages remain on the same line as the assert macro.\n\nNo functional changes; test behavior and coverage are preserved.",
